### Objectives

1. Develop a conversational agent to improve customer service at CBRICENHO E.I.R.L
2. Reduce response times for: frequent queries, appointment scheduling, quote generation
3. Evaluate usability and functionality through software quality metrics
4. Measure customer satisfaction improvement (PRE-TEST vs POST-TEST)

### Key Metrics to Track

| Metric                            | Formula           | Purpose                        |
| --------------------------------- | ----------------- | ------------------------------ |
| Average response time             | x̄ = Σxi/n         | Measure query response speed   |
| Average appointment creation time | x̄ = Σxi/n         | Measure scheduling efficiency  |
| Average quote generation time     | x̄ = Σxi/n         | Measure quote processing speed |
| Customer satisfaction index       | p = Σ(pi/n) × 100 | LIKERT scale (1-5) evaluation  |

