## 📝 DIALOGFLOW GUIDELINES

### Intent Naming Convention

- Use snake_case for intent names
- Prefix with category: `faq_`, `cita_`, `cotizar_`
- Examples: `faq_horarios`, `cita_local_confirmar`, `cotizar_laptop`

### Entity Naming Convention

- Use snake_case with @ prefix in documentation
- Custom entities: `@tipo_equipo`, `@tipo_servicio`, `@modelo_equipo`
- System entities: `@sys.date`, `@sys.time`, `@sys.phone-number`

### Context Naming Convention

- Use descriptive names: `cita_local_en_curso`, `cotizacion_pendiente`
- Set appropriate lifespan (typically 5 for multi-turn conversations)

### Training Phrases Requirements

- Minimum 10-15 training phrases per intent
- Include variations with typos, colloquialisms
- Cover formal and informal Spanish
- Include Peruvian Spanish expressions
- Examples:
  - "quiero sacar una cita"
  - "quisiera agendar una cita"
  - "necesito una cita para mi laptop"
  - "pueden revisar mi compu?"
  - "mi pc no prende, puedo llevarla?"

