## ⚙️ BUSINESS RULES

### Appointment Rules

- Maximum booking window: 7 calendar days ahead
- Operating hours: Mon-Fri 8:00-18:00, Sat 8:00-13:00
- Maximum simultaneous appointments: 3 (configurable)
- Session timeout: 30 minutes of inactivity
- Home service coverage: Paita district only

### Quote Rules

- Products must exist in database with isActive: true
- Services have fixed or calculated pricing
- Quotes valid for: 7 days (configurable)
- IGV (tax): 18% for Peru
- Minimum quote amount: S/ 50.00

