## 📚 GLOSSARY

| Term                 | Definition                                               |
| -------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------- |
| **Intent**           | Classification of user intention in Dialogflow           |
| **Entity**           | Data type extracted from user expressions                |
| **Context**          | State that controls conversation flow                    |
| **Webhook**          | HTTP endpoint receiving Dialogflow notifications         |
| **Fulfillment**      | Backend code processing intents and generating responses |
| **NLU**              | Natural Language Understanding                           |
| **PLN**              | Procesamiento del Lenguaje Natural (Spanish)             |
| **Training phrases** | Example phrases to train an intent                       |
| **Fallback intent**  | Intent activated when no match found                     |
| **Session**          | Unique identifier for a conversation                     |
| **CRC Cards**        | Class-Responsibility-Collaborator design cards (XP)      |
| **User Story**       | XP requirement format from user perspective              |

